          "text": "ቦ ፡ ዘይትለዐከኒ ፡ ለይትልወኒ ፡ እስመ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኀበ ፡ ሀሎኩ ፡ አነ ፡ ህየ ፡ ይሄሉ ፡ ዘይት",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለዐከኒ ፡ ሲል ፡ የሰማችሁት ፡ ነው፡ እንጂ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወአኮ ፡ በእንቲአነ ፡ ባሕቲቱ ፡ ላለው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አኮ ፡ በእንተ ፡ እሉ ፡ ባሕቲቶሙ ፡ ዘእስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እለከ ፡ አላ ፡ በእንተሂ ፡ እለ ፡ የአምኑ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብየ ፡ በቃሎሙ ፡ ሲል ፡ የሰማችሁት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነው ፡ እንጂ ፡ ለእመ ፡ ዐቀብነ ፡ ትእዛዞ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ላለው ፡ ወእመሰ ፡ ታፈቅሩኒ ፡ ዕቀቡ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትእዛዝየ ፡ ዘያፈቅረኒ ፡ ይዕቀብ ፡ ቃልየ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሲል ፡ የሰማችሁት ፡ ነው ፡ እንጂ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": "፰",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፰ ፤ ⟪ወካዕበ ፡ ትእዛዘ ፡ ሐዲሰ ፡ እጽሕፍ ፡ ለክሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዳግመኛም ፡ እንግዳ ፡ ትእዛዝን። አንድም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንግዳ ፡ ትእዛዝ ፡ አድርጌ ፡ እጽፍላች",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኋለሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
