          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድንቁርና። አንድም ፡ ኦሪት ፡ አልፋለችና፤",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወብርሃን ፡ ዘበአማን ፡ ወድአ ፡ አስተርአየ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዕውቀት ፡ ወንጌል፡ ፈጽሞ ፡ ተሰጥትዋል",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ና ፡ ሮሜ ፡ ፲፫ ፥ ፲፪ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": "፱",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፱ ፤ ⟪ወዘሰ ፡ ይብል ፡ ውስተ ፡ ብርሃን ፡ ሀሎኩ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
