          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢንሬእዮሙ ፡ ለእሙንቱ ፡ ወእሙንቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢይሬእዩነ ፡ እስመ ፡ ጽልመት ፡ ሀሎ ፡",
